":"### Tested versions\n\nmaster\n\n### System information\n\nGithub Actions Windows runner: Microsoft Windows Server 2022\n\n### Issue description\n\nI recently changed something in my Github Action for Windows to build Godot, and suddenly it failed on this error:\n\n```\nscons: Reading SConscript files ...\nSCons cache enabled... (path: \"D:\\a\\godot_voxel\\godot_voxel/.scons_cache/\")\nUnicodeEncodeError: 'charmap' codec can't encode character '\\u221e' in position 23: character maps to <undefined>:\n  File \"D:\\a\\godot_voxel\\godot_voxel\\SConstruct\", line 290:\n    methods.prepare_cache(env)\n  File \"D:\\a\\godot_voxel\\godot_voxel\\methods.py\", line 881:\n    print(\n  File \"C:\\hostedtoolcache\\windows\\Python\\3.13.2\\x64\\Lib\\site-packages\\SCons\\Util\\__init__.py\", line 1246:\n    self.file.write(arg)\n  File \"C:\\hostedtoolcache\\windows\\Python\\3.13.2\\x64\\Lib\\encodings\\cp1252.py\", line 19:\n    return codecs.charmap_encode(input,self.errors,encoding_table)[0]\n```\nhttps://github.com/Zylann/godot_voxel/actions/runs/13639572107/job/38126155601\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nThe issue is in `methods.py` where it tries to print the character `∞`: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/9f68a816599412c56a4626dd6c47244ebc65ed1f/methods.py#L883\n\nI suppose it happens if you don't define a `cache_limit`, which I happened to uncover now.\n\nBoth `cache_limit` and `∞` were introduced in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/0e4a4e3c4d602691ce1b4fc6a721c5c637ead57f.\n\nI tried to workaround it by adding either of the following before the call to SCons:\n```\nset PYTHONIOENCODING=utf8\nset PYTHONIOENCODING=utf-8\n$env:PYTHONIOENCODING=utf8\n```\nAnd [incremented the cache ID](https://github.com/Zylann/godot_voxel/blob/7407394ac3d84d14ae79ba35c20101c142de3b57/.github/workflows/windows.yml#L76), but none of these worked. (to my understanding it should have worked though, so maybe I'm missing something)\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN.A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103520/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":1,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103520/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}